WEBVTT

00:02:00.049 --> 00:02:40.484
☆Sarah saw a nice jacket on an online shopping website. It was a little expensive, but she decided to buy it. When the jacket arrived, however, she was disappointed because it was not the right color. She called the company that ran the online shopping website, but they told her that they could not exchange it. Sarah learned her lesson and bought the same jacket at a local clothing store.
☆☆Question: Why was Sarah disappointed?
